{"seq":4,"slug":"screen-reader","title":"屏幕阅读器适配","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/accessibility-i18n/web-accessibility/screen-reader","wordCount":783,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"屏幕阅读器适配\">屏幕阅读器适配</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>屏幕阅读器（Screen Reader）是视障用户访问 Web 内容的主要工具。它解析页面的可访问性树（Accessibility Tree），将视觉界面转化为语音输出或盲文显示。开发者需要理解屏幕阅读器的工作方式和用户的操作习惯，才能构建真正可访问的 Web 应用。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[HTML DOM] --&gt; B[浏览器解析]&#10;    B --&gt; C[可访问性树 AOM]&#10;    C --&gt; D[平台无障碍 API]&#10;    D --&gt; E[屏幕阅读器]&#10;    E --&gt; F[语音输出]&#10;    E --&gt; G[盲文显示]&#10;&#10;    subgraph AOM 节点属性&#10;        H[角色 Role]&#10;        I[名称 Accessible Name]&#10;        J[描述 Description]&#10;        K[状态 State]&#10;        L[关系 Relationship]&#10;    end\">graph TD\n    A[HTML DOM] --&gt; B[浏览器解析]\n    B --&gt; C[可访问性树 AOM]\n    C --&gt; D[平台无障碍 API]\n    D --&gt; E[屏幕阅读器]\n    E --&gt; F[语音输出]\n    E --&gt; G[盲文显示]\n\n    subgraph AOM 节点属性\n        H[角色 Role]\n        I[名称 Accessible Name]\n        J[描述 Description]\n        K[状态 State]\n        L[关系 Relationship]\n    end</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>屏幕阅读器</th>\n<th>平台</th>\n<th>常用浏览器搭配</th>\n<th>市场份额</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>NVDA</td>\n<td>Windows</td>\n<td>Firefox / Chrome</td>\n<td>~30%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>JAWS</td>\n<td>Windows</td>\n<td>Chrome / Edge</td>\n<td>~40%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>VoiceOver</td>\n<td>macOS / iOS</td>\n<td>Safari</td>\n<td>~20%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>TalkBack</td>\n<td>Android</td>\n<td>Chrome</td>\n<td>~10%</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"可访问名称计算\">可访问名称计算</h2><p>可访问名称（Accessible Name）是屏幕阅读器朗读元素时使用的文本。名称的计算遵循严格的优先级规则，理解这个优先级对于调试无障碍问题至关重要。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"const accessibleNamePriority = `&#10;&lt;!-- 优先级从高到低 --&gt;&#10;&#10;&lt;!-- 1. aria-labelledby（最高优先级） --&gt;&#10;&lt;button aria-labelledby=&quot;btn-label&quot;&gt;&#10;  &lt;span id=&quot;btn-label&quot;&gt;保存设置&lt;/span&gt;&#10;&lt;/button&gt;&#10;&#10;&lt;!-- 2. aria-label --&gt;&#10;&lt;button aria-label=&quot;关闭对话框&quot;&gt;&#10;  &lt;svg&gt;...&lt;/svg&gt;&#10;&lt;/button&gt;&#10;&#10;&lt;!-- 3. &lt;label&gt; 关联（仅表单控件） --&gt;&#10;&lt;label for=&quot;search&quot;&gt;搜索&lt;/label&gt;&#10;&lt;input id=&quot;search&quot; type=&quot;text&quot; /&gt;&#10;&#10;&lt;!-- 4. 文本内容 --&gt;&#10;&lt;button&gt;提交订单&lt;/button&gt;&#10;&lt;a href=&quot;/docs&quot;&gt;查看文档&lt;/a&gt;&#10;&#10;&lt;!-- 5. title 属性（最低优先级） --&gt;&#10;&lt;abbr title=&quot;Web Content Accessibility Guidelines&quot;&gt;WCAG&lt;/abbr&gt;&#10;&#10;&lt;!-- 6. placeholder（不应作为唯一标签） --&gt;&#10;&lt;input placeholder=&quot;请输入用户名&quot; /&gt;  &lt;!-- 仅作为提示，不是名称 --&gt;&#10;`;&#10;&#10;// 调试：查看元素的可访问名称&#10;const getAccessibleName = (element: HTMLElement): string =&gt; {&#10;  return element.getAttribute(&#39;aria-labelledby&#39;)&#10;    ? (document.getElementById(element.getAttribute(&#39;aria-labelledby&#39;)!)?.textContent ?? &#39;&#39;)&#10;    : (element.getAttribute(&#39;aria-label&#39;) ?? element.textContent ?? &#39;&#39;);&#10;};\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> accessibleNamePriority</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> `</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">&#x3C;!-- 优先级从高到低 --></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">&#x3C;!-- 1. aria-labelledby（最高优先级） --></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">&#x3C;button aria-labelledby=\"btn-label\"></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">  &#x3C;span id=\"btn-label\">保存设置&#x3C;/span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">&#x3C;/button></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">&#x3C;!-- 2. aria-label --></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">&#x3C;button aria-label=\"关闭对话框\"></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">  &#x3C;svg>...&#x3C;/svg></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">&#x3C;/button></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">&#x3C;!-- 3. &#x3C;label> 关联（仅表单控件） --></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">&#x3C;label for=\"search\">搜索&#x3C;/label></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">&#x3C;input id=\"search\" type=\"text\" /></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">&#x3C;!-- 4. 文本内容 --></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">&#x3C;button>提交订单&#x3C;/button></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">&#x3C;a href=\"/docs\">查看文档&#x3C;/a></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">&#x3C;!-- 5. title 属性（最低优先级） --></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">&#x3C;abbr title=\"Web Content Accessibility Guidelines\">WCAG&#x3C;/abbr></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">&#x3C;!-- 6. placeholder（不应作为唯一标签） --></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">&#x3C;input placeholder=\"请输入用户名\" />  &#x3C;!-- 仅作为提示，不是名称 --></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">`</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 调试：查看元素的可访问名称</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> getAccessibleName</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">element</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> HTMLElement</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> element.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">getAttribute</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'aria-labelledby'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    ?</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (document.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">getElementById</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(element.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">getAttribute</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'aria-labelledby'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">!</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)?.textContent </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">??</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> ''</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    :</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (element.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">getAttribute</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'aria-label'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">??</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> element.textContent </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">??</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> ''</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">};</span></span></code></pre></div><p>常见的可访问名称问题：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>问题</th>\n<th>示例</th>\n<th>修复方案</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>无名称</td>\n<td><code>&lt;button&gt;&lt;svg/&gt;&lt;/button&gt;</code></td>\n<td>添加 aria-label</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>重复名称</td>\n<td>多个&quot;点击这里&quot;链接</td>\n<td>使用描述性文本</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>仅 placeholder</td>\n<td><code>&lt;input placeholder=&quot;姓名&quot;&gt;</code></td>\n<td>添加 <code>&lt;label&gt;</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>名称不匹配</td>\n<td>aria-label 与可见文本不同</td>\n<td>保持一致</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"动态内容通知\">动态内容通知</h2><p>单页应用（SPA）中，内容变化不会被屏幕阅读器自动感知。Live Region 机制让屏幕阅读器在内容动态更新时主动朗读变化。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"const liveRegions = `&#10;&lt;!-- aria-live=&quot;polite&quot;：等当前朗读完毕后播报 --&gt;&#10;&lt;div aria-live=&quot;polite&quot; aria-atomic=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&#10;  搜索结果：找到 42 条记录&#10;&lt;/div&gt;&#10;&#10;&lt;!-- aria-live=&quot;assertive&quot;：立即中断当前朗读 --&gt;&#10;&lt;div aria-live=&quot;assertive&quot; role=&quot;alert&quot;&gt;&#10;  操作失败：网络连接超时&#10;&lt;/div&gt;&#10;&#10;&lt;!-- role=&quot;status&quot;：等价于 aria-live=&quot;polite&quot; --&gt;&#10;&lt;div role=&quot;status&quot;&gt;正在加载...&lt;/div&gt;&#10;&#10;&lt;!-- role=&quot;alert&quot;：等价于 aria-live=&quot;assertive&quot; --&gt;&#10;&lt;div role=&quot;alert&quot;&gt;您的密码即将过期&lt;/div&gt;&#10;&#10;&lt;!-- aria-atomic：播报整个区域还是仅变化部分 --&gt;&#10;&lt;div aria-live=&quot;polite&quot; aria-atomic=&quot;false&quot;&gt;&#10;  &lt;span&gt;已选择 3 项&lt;/span&gt;  &lt;!-- 只朗读变化的部分 --&gt;&#10;&lt;/div&gt;&#10;`&#10;&#10;// React 中的 Live Region 实现&#10;const useAnnounce = () =&gt; {&#10;  const [message, setMessage] = useState(&#39;&#39;)&#10;&#10;  const announce = (text: string, priority: &#39;polite&#39; | &#39;assertive&#39; = &#39;polite&#39;) =&gt; {&#10;    setMessage(&#39;&#39;)&#10;    requestAnimationFrame(() =&gt; setMessage(text))&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  const AnnouncerRegion = () =&gt; (&#10;    &lt;div&#10;      aria-live=&quot;polite&quot;&#10;      aria-atomic=&quot;true&quot;&#10;      className=&quot;sr-only&quot;&#10;    &gt;&#10;      {message}&#10;    &lt;/div&gt;&#10;  )&#10;&#10;  return { announce, AnnouncerRegion }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> liveRegions</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> `</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">&#x3C;!-- aria-live=\"polite\"：等当前朗读完毕后播报 --></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">&#x3C;div aria-live=\"polite\" aria-atomic=\"true\"></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">  搜索结果：找到 42 条记录</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">&#x3C;/div></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">&#x3C;!-- aria-live=\"assertive\"：立即中断当前朗读 --></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">&#x3C;div aria-live=\"assertive\" role=\"alert\"></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">  操作失败：网络连接超时</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">&#x3C;/div></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">&#x3C;!-- role=\"status\"：等价于 aria-live=\"polite\" --></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">&#x3C;div role=\"status\">正在加载...&#x3C;/div></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">&#x3C;!-- role=\"alert\"：等价于 aria-live=\"assertive\" --></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">&#x3C;div role=\"alert\">您的密码即将过期&#x3C;/div></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">&#x3C;!-- aria-atomic：播报整个区域还是仅变化部分 --></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">&#x3C;div aria-live=\"polite\" aria-atomic=\"false\"></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">  &#x3C;span>已选择 3 项&#x3C;/span>  &#x3C;!-- 只朗读变化的部分 --></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">&#x3C;/div></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">`</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// React 中的 Live Region 实现</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> useAnnounce</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> () </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">message</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">setMessage</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> useState</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">''</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> announce</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">text</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">priority</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'polite'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'assertive'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'polite'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    setMessage</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">''</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    requestAnimationFrame</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(() </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> setMessage</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(text))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> AnnouncerRegion</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> () </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">div</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      aria</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">live</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"polite\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      aria</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">atomic</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"true\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      className</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"sr-only\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    ></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      {</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">message</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    &#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">div</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  )</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { announce, AnnouncerRegion }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Live Region 属性</th>\n<th>值</th>\n<th>行为</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>aria-live</td>\n<td>polite</td>\n<td>等待当前朗读完毕后播报</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>aria-live</td>\n<td>assertive</td>\n<td>立即中断并播报</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>aria-atomic</td>\n<td>true</td>\n<td>播报整个区域内容</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>aria-atomic</td>\n<td>false</td>\n<td>仅播报变化部分</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>aria-relevant</td>\n<td>additions</td>\n<td>仅在新增内容时播报</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>aria-relevant</td>\n<td>removals</td>\n<td>仅在删除内容时播报</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>aria-relevant</td>\n<td>text</td>\n<td>仅在文本变化时播报</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"视觉隐藏文本\">视觉隐藏文本</h2><p>某些信息只需要对屏幕阅读器可见，视觉上应隐藏。例如图标按钮的文字标签、表格的额外上下文说明等。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"const visuallyHiddenCSS = `&#10;/* sr-only 类：视觉隐藏但屏幕阅读器可读 */&#10;.sr-only {&#10;  position: absolute;&#10;  width: 1px;&#10;  height: 1px;&#10;  padding: 0;&#10;  margin: -1px;&#10;  overflow: hidden;&#10;  clip: rect(0, 0, 0, 0);&#10;  white-space: nowrap;&#10;  border-width: 0;&#10;}&#10;&#10;/* 使用示例 */&#10;/* &lt;button&gt;&#10;     &lt;svg aria-hidden=&quot;true&quot;&gt;...&lt;/svg&gt;&#10;     &lt;span class=&quot;sr-only&quot;&gt;删除&lt;/span&gt;&#10;   &lt;/button&gt; */&#10;&#10;/* 注意：以下方式会同时对屏幕阅读器隐藏 */&#10;/* display: none — 完全从 AOM 中移除 */&#10;/* visibility: hidden — 完全从 AOM 中移除 */&#10;/* aria-hidden=&quot;true&quot; — 从 AOM 中移除但仍占据空间 */&#10;`;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> visuallyHiddenCSS</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> `</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">/* sr-only 类：视觉隐藏但屏幕阅读器可读 */</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">.sr-only {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">  position: absolute;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">  width: 1px;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">  height: 1px;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">  padding: 0;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">  margin: -1px;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">  overflow: hidden;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">  clip: rect(0, 0, 0, 0);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">  white-space: nowrap;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">  border-width: 0;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">/* 使用示例 */</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">/* &#x3C;button></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">     &#x3C;svg aria-hidden=\"true\">...&#x3C;/svg></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">     &#x3C;span class=\"sr-only\">删除&#x3C;/span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">   &#x3C;/button> */</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">/* 注意：以下方式会同时对屏幕阅读器隐藏 */</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">/* display: none — 完全从 AOM 中移除 */</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">/* visibility: hidden — 完全从 AOM 中移除 */</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">/* aria-hidden=\"true\" — 从 AOM 中移除但仍占据空间 */</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">`</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>隐藏方式</th>\n<th>视觉可见</th>\n<th>屏幕阅读器可读</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>sr-only CSS</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>图标按钮标签、额外上下文</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>display: none</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>完全隐藏</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>visibility: hidden</td>\n<td>否（占空间）</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>布局占位但隐藏</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>aria-hidden=&quot;true&quot;</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>装饰元素、重复信息</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>hidden 属性</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>等价于 display: none</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"测试与调试\">测试与调试</h2><p>屏幕阅读器适配必须通过实际屏幕阅读器测试验证。自动化工具只能检测技术合规性，无法评估用户体验。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"// 测试流程&#10;const screenReaderTestChecklist = [&#10;  &#39;使用 Tab 键导航所有交互元素&#39;,&#10;  &#39;验证焦点顺序是否合理&#39;,&#10;  &#39;检查所有按钮/链接是否有可访问名称&#39;,&#10;  &#39;验证图片 alt 文本是否准确&#39;,&#10;  &#39;测试表单填写和错误提示流程&#39;,&#10;  &#39;验证模态对话框的焦点管理&#39;,&#10;  &#39;检查动态内容更新是否被播报&#39;,&#10;  &#39;验证页面标题是否准确描述页面&#39;,&#10;  &#39;测试跳过导航链接是否可用&#39;,&#10;];&#10;&#10;// Chrome DevTools 可访问性面板&#10;// Elements → Accessibility 面板可查看：&#10;// - Computed Properties（计算后的角色、名称、状态）&#10;// - Accessibility Tree（可访问性树结构）&#10;// - ARIA Attributes（ARIA 属性）&#10;&#10;// 浏览器扩展&#10;const a11yTools = {&#10;  axeDevTools: &#39;Chrome/Firefox 扩展，自动检测无障碍问题&#39;,&#10;  accessibilityInsights: &#39;Microsoft 提供的免费检测工具&#39;,&#10;  headingsMap: &#39;可视化标题层级结构&#39;,&#10;  landmarkNavigation: &#39;可视化地标区域&#39;,&#10;};\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 测试流程</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> screenReaderTestChecklist</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">  '使用 Tab 键导航所有交互元素'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">  '验证焦点顺序是否合理'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">  '检查所有按钮/链接是否有可访问名称'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">  '验证图片 alt 文本是否准确'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">  '测试表单填写和错误提示流程'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">  '验证模态对话框的焦点管理'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">  '检查动态内容更新是否被播报'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">  '验证页面标题是否准确描述页面'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">  '测试跳过导航链接是否可用'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// Chrome DevTools 可访问性面板</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// Elements → Accessibility 面板可查看：</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// - Computed Properties（计算后的角色、名称、状态）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// - Accessibility Tree（可访问性树结构）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// - ARIA Attributes（ARIA 属性）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 浏览器扩展</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> a11yTools</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  axeDevTools: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'Chrome/Firefox 扩展，自动检测无障碍问题'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  accessibilityInsights: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'Microsoft 提供的免费检测工具'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  headingsMap: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'可视化标题层级结构'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  landmarkNavigation: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'可视化地标区域'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">};</span></span></code></pre></div><p>macOS 上可以直接使用 VoiceOver（Cmd + F5 开启），Windows 上推荐免费的 NVDA。建议每个 Sprint 至少进行一次屏幕阅读器手动测试。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>屏幕阅读器通过可访问性树（AOM）理解页面，AOM 的质量决定用户体验</li>\n<li>可访问名称计算有严格优先级：aria-labelledby &gt; aria-label &gt; label &gt; 文本内容 &gt; title</li>\n<li>Live Region（aria-live）是 SPA 动态内容通知的标准方案，polite 等待、assertive 立即播报</li>\n<li>sr-only 类实现视觉隐藏但屏幕阅读器可读，display:none 和 aria-hidden=&quot;true&quot; 会同时隐藏</li>\n<li>自动化工具（axe-core）只能检测技术合规，真正的用户体验需要手动屏幕阅读器测试</li>\n<li>每个 Sprint 至少进行一次手动屏幕阅读器测试，覆盖 Tab 导航、表单、动态内容等核心场景</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"屏幕阅读器适配","id":"屏幕阅读器适配"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"可访问名称计算","id":"可访问名称计算"},{"level":2,"text":"动态内容通知","id":"动态内容通知"},{"level":2,"text":"视觉隐藏文本","id":"视觉隐藏文本"},{"level":2,"text":"测试与调试","id":"测试与调试"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"键盘导航","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/accessibility-i18n/web-accessibility/keyboard-navigation"},"next":{"title":"ARIA 基础","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/accessibility-i18n/aria-and-testing/aria-fundamentals"}}